QUERY NAME: qryCSG7_Tests
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT tblTestRequ.Project, tblTestRequ.Year AS YearNo, Sum([NoTests]*[unitprice]) AS cost, "Other Costs" AS Category
FROM tblTestRequ
GROUP BY tblTestRequ.Project, tblTestRequ.Year
HAVING (((tblTestRequ.Project)=[Forms]![frmProject1]![Project]));

